{"steam_appid":774801,"steam_name":"Crab Champions","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/774801/860422/1dcd799d73f0464b7d080e353e1da36962b47ebe/1750582419/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743354496","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257120164/71e36804381814942584602de462e76590c7f269/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743354496","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/5cd08b498cd015a49061500bc7c7e693a7a57500/ss_5cd08b498cd015a49061500bc7c7e693a7a57500.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785701226","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/c9ec8a4e69786f5f6202ee4466e0b7dd76f0b0df/ss_c9ec8a4e69786f5f6202ee4466e0b7dd76f0b0df.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785701226","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/e1c19eecb6762d0db327fdb8d11d50cd4e2b8795/ss_e1c19eecb6762d0db327fdb8d11d50cd4e2b8795.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785701226","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/819e5f207f4eee8d2b223a7422f94135beb51b28/ss_819e5f207f4eee8d2b223a7422f94135beb51b28.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785701226","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/ss_781c4177ac5606a4bed396e26cc80b380c0f4aae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785701226"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crab Champions is a fast paced roguelike shooter. Travel solo or with friends across exotic islands defeating hordes of enemies, collecting loot and becoming as powerful as possible creating game breaking builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/f75e0040c856e25aa83b804443b05fd5.poster.avif?t=1785701226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/f75e0040c856e25aa83b804443b05fd5.webm?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/f75e0040c856e25aa83b804443b05fd5.mp4?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Run based: the fun of a looter shooter packed into intense 20-40 minute runs with the option to loop endlessly to survive as long as you can!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth and responsive movement and combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carefully crafted visuals with a focus on quality while maintaining high performance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack made specifically for the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete challenges to unlock cosmetic skins and put your skills to the test in Nightmare difficulty with modifiers to spice things up even further</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or assemble a multiplayer squad: the game is balanced separately for different party sizes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice matters: each run presents you with different loot combinations, enemy types and tough decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo developed by the creator of Crab Rave 🦀</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No lootboxes, microtransactions or ANY additional purchases required- all content is available to unlock in game by playing<br>  </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHAOTIC FUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/be7b89ef923a322214a71e2139279a6f.poster.avif?t=1785701226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/be7b89ef923a322214a71e2139279a6f.webm?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/be7b89ef923a322214a71e2139279a6f.mp4?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARKOUR ISLANDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/67821d6fbb5f1cd141c990251ab2f1d6.poster.avif?t=1785701226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/67821d6fbb5f1cd141c990251ab2f1d6.webm?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/67821d6fbb5f1cd141c990251ab2f1d6.mp4?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEEP BUILD CRAFTING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/f9cc0338287752685714fd852f8c06c6.poster.avif?t=1785701226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/f9cc0338287752685714fd852f8c06c6.webm?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/f9cc0338287752685714fd852f8c06c6.mp4?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TONS OF LOOT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/3ecdadfee0e18bd81d22c60877d52bfd.poster.avif?t=1785701226\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/3ecdadfee0e18bd81d22c60877d52bfd.webm?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/774801/extras/3ecdadfee0e18bd81d22c60877d52bfd.mp4?t=1785701226\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>WARNING: This game allows you to create over the top and visually intense builds that may create flashing lights that could be potentially unsuitable for those that have an epileptic condition.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i3 3.3 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","Early Access"],"developers":["Noisestorm"],"publishers":["Noisestorm"],"release_date":"1 Apr, 2023"}